@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Content conversion, deferred URN repair 其他 manual reconversion

autonumber
participant "Bridge converter" as Converter
participant "Private Workspace API" as API
database "Canonical MESSAGE + hidden latest raw metadata" as DB
database "Deferred references" as Deferred
participant "Manual versioned reconversion tool" as Tool
database "Outbox + ready events" as Events

Converter -> Converter : Zulip markup -> canonical Workspace Markdown/URN
Converter -> API : content + latest raw payload/hash/revision
API -> DB : store public canonical Markdown;
API -> DB : store hidden latest raw + converter version

alt Older message/file mapping missing
  API -> Deferred : store provider target key + source message + status
else All URNs resolved
  API -> Events : outbox for actual state transition
end

Deferred -> API : target mapping appeared; idempotent repair
alt Canonical content/mentions changed
  API -> DB : update derived URNs/mentions
  API -> Events : one outbox/ready-event path
else no-op
  API --> Deferred : completed without event
end

Tool -> API : dry-run scoped batch using hidden latest raw
API --> Tool : validation diff/manifest
Tool -> API : explicit apply
API -> DB : content/URN/mentions only
API -> Events : actual changes only

note over Converter,Tool
  Public REST/WS/log/error never exposes raw payload.
  Raw revision history is not stored.
  Reconnection does not run heavy reconversion automatically.
end note

@enduml
